{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00748","headline":"郊庙歌辞 享文敬太子庙乐章 请神 · 许孟容","name":"郊庙歌辞 享文敬太子庙乐章 请神","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"觞牢具品，管磬有节。\n祝道夤恭，神仪昭晰。\n桐圭早贵，象辂追设。\n声达乐成，降歆丰洁。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"许孟容","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_00748.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00748","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}